    "result": "## Answer\n\nElectronics = group `g2` (dominant `main_cat`: Computers / All Electronics / Camera & Photo / Cell Phones). Verified facts: `prc` is cents and `prc_usd = prc/100` (zero mismatches), so \"list price ≤ $40\" is `prc_usd <= 40` (equivalently `prc <= 4000`, same result). Reviews join cleanly on `ref_id` (0 orphans), `rtg` is integer 1–5.\n\nResult: **2172** electronics reviews with body > 500 chars on products with list price ≤ $40, of which **222** are 1-star → **10.22%**.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"answer\": \"10.22%\",\n  \"sql\": \"SELECT ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN f.rtg = 1.0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*), 2) AS pct_1star FROM fdbk_g2 f JOIN items_g2 i ON f.ref_id = i.ref_id WHERE LENGTH(f.body) > 500 AND i.prc_usd <= 40;\"\n}\n```\n\nMemory saved: `memory/environment.md` (schema, group↔category mapping [inference], price encoding [verified], data-quality facts) and `memory/MEMORY.md` index.",
